    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899547305857024
    m_Localized: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899800574709760
    m_Localized: 'Batlle rewards :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899878995611648
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899917964890112
    m_Localized: 'Item(s) found :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3914717289730048
    m_Localized: Heal 100 LP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803000768286720
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803074814529536
    m_Localized: Are you ready for your training ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803205932666880
    m_Localized: Yes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803246550306816
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803377567780864
    m_Localized: All right. Today we are going to review the basics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6804222082502656
    m_Localized: The battle are turned based. Each players attack one after the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6804991338827776
    m_Localized: Let's begin with the attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805327965278208
    m_Localized: To attack, press "attack"  boutton.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805550217252864
    m_Localized: We are going to try that in a real fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805667733262336
    m_Localized: Are you ready ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805704215318528
    m_Localized: Yes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805730631045120
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805779431772160
    m_Localized: Well then, let's go !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805947128434688
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806256617738240
    m_Localized: Good fight !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806531843772416
    m_Localized: But some ennemies are difficult to beat with simple attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806722323894272
    m_Localized: How to beat them then ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806781912371200
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806857300791296
    m_Localized: In this case, you have to use magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987417142906880
    m_Localized: But, I can't use magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987519660085248
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987547984220160
    m_Localized: Don't worry. For the next fight, you will be join by Vard who can
      use magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987719074074624
    m_Localized: Are you ready Vard ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987837915484160
    m_Localized: Yes, I will fight with Marco !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987920304197632
    m_Localized: Great !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987943981043712
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988117205798912
    m_Localized: All right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988171719168000
    m_Localized: To use magic, you need to press the "magic" button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988368394276864
    m_Localized: Then choose the magic to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988444520894464
    m_Localized: Unlike normal attack, magic or technique use your Magic Point or
      MP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988743847399424
    m_Localized: The MP are limited, so remember to check your MP before a fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988944817475584
    m_Localized: Are you ready ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989018809192448
    m_Localized: Yes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989068016766976
    m_Localized: I am ready !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989110274379776
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989207104081920
    m_Localized: All right then, let's go !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989355263676416
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989392995635200
    m_Localized: We reviewed the basic fight move together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989561979949056
    m_Localized: I think you are ready for tomorrow exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989832885850112
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989915442335744
    m_Localized: I hope you are ready for your exam ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990026050326528
    m_Localized: Yes, we are ready !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990088067305472
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990125774098432
    m_Localized: All right ! I will be your examiner today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990756949741568
    m_Localized: You are going to fight with me. This way I will check your fighting
      skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990968690790400
    m_Localized: If you beat me, your exam will be succeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991121417981952
    m_Localized: Prepare to fight !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991449114759168
    m_Localized: I was told that the D-UNI was here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991631285964800
    m_Localized: Nobody passes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991678614491136
    m_Localized: Look everywhere !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991766124449792
    m_Localized: If you have any information, you have to tell us !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991982567313408
    m_Localized: Search in the houses !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992083008311296
    m_Localized: Nobody go outside !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992159663411200
    m_Localized: Nobody go outside !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992239799783424
    m_Localized: 'Nobody go outside ! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992466388668416
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992520587464704
    m_Localized: Those creatures are dangerous. Let the soldat take care of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992697838751744
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992724699074560
    m_Localized: Oh my god, this is horrible !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992928001183744
    m_Localized: n-Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993071744176128
    m_Localized: I hope they will catch those monster !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993207639625728
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993243760971776
    m_Localized: I have never seen a metamorph in my life. People said they look
      like wild animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993547646685184
    m_Localized: It was a good training session.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993633457950720
    m_Localized: I think you are ready for tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993848281812992
    m_Localized: Let go to sleep. It'll will be good for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994499996962816
    m_Localized: Dear residents !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994588119289856
    m_Localized: We are here beacause metamorphes have been seen nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994812103512064
    m_Localized: Those creatures are accused of the murder of the king of Moonshine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995081340080128
    m_Localized: If you have any information that can help us find them, you can
      came to us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995376098988032
    m_Localized: Be carefull, those creatures are dangerous. Don't go close to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995570635001856
    m_Localized: If you see them, call us immediatelly !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995703086927872
    m_Localized: We are going to search the houses and the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6996024232202240
    m_Localized: I am warning you. If someone try to help those murderer, this person
      wil be arrest as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6996424029065216
    m_Localized: Stay here while we search the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6996552748060672
    m_Localized: I need to inform the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997365151191040
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997402774097920
    m_Localized: It was a good fight..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997524085952512
    m_Localized: You are ready to begin your training to become a knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997675223502848
    m_Localized: The path will be long, but I will help you as much as I can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997819796967424
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997876009029632
    m_Localized: What's next ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997927162761216
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997961023377408
    m_Localized: I wil be in charge of your mentor. I will teach you everything you
      need to know about the world and how to become a knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6998337554436096
    m_Localized: You will also be joined by Mok. He has passed his exam last year
      and will help you during the fights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003142339383296
    m_Localized: I am happy to be with Mok.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003224174448640
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003279413432320
    m_Localized: Now, I am going to talk about your missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003436666277888
    m_Localized: Of course, we will be training your fighting skills. Because fighting
      will be a great part of your missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003762173628416
    m_Localized: We need to be able to protect people against thief or monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003953907847168
    m_Localized: We can encounter some outside the village, on the road or in the
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004146065690624
    m_Localized: But some of the monster will be in the donjons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004357366337536
    m_Localized: However, donjons contains usefull resources for our development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004573477851136
    m_Localized: That's why, during your training we will also go to donjons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004906111324160
    m_Localized: But our role is not only to fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005107609882624
    m_Localized: Our role is to assist peoples.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005214501720064
    m_Localized: That is why, we will begin by talking to people to see if someone
      need our help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005493905281024
    m_Localized: Now that I am with you, you can also get outside the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005639418269696
    m_Localized: The neighbour village does not have knight post. We should also
      go see if they need help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006113764691968
    m_Localized: Before leaving, you should go to the shop to buy new equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006254550700032
    m_Localized: I can't wait to begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006332875132928
    m_Localized: With you, I feel safe. And if we are hurt, we could always go see
      Rose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7144238583336960
    m_Localized: Welcome to Medieville
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7148466575986688
    m_Localized: Wasp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7731136954044416
    m_Localized: Hello Guys !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7731225055399936
    m_Localized: I heard that a spider has been seen in the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7731508963643392
    m_Localized: Do you want to come with me to track it ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7731958655946752
    m_Localized: Yes, it will be a good training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7732134791548928
    m_Localized: Ok, let's go then !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7732478674145280
    m_Localized: I would like to bake an apple pie, but I don't have any apple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7732497179414528
    m_Localized: n-Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7732815489339392
    m_Localized: There is some in the forest, but I am afraid to go there because
      of the monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7733172919537664
    m_Localized: Don't worry, we are can go get some apples for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7733427773837312
    m_Localized: n-Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7733458438393856
    m_Localized: Thank you very much !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7733643239428096
    m_Localized: Thank you for the apples, I can cook my pie now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7734313921220608
    m_Localized: Great, let's go !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7734747549339648
    m_Localized: I've been asked to watch your exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7742061018812416
    m_Localized: join the group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7743130016878592
    m_Localized: leave the group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7761884054491136
    m_Localized: Save in progress, do not turn off the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7762082730283008
    m_Localized: Save completed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7765603403894784
    m_Localized: STRAWBERRY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7765764934930432
    m_Localized: Strawberry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7766892263182336
    m_Localized: Heal 5 MP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767161143234560
    m_Localized: BONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767185956737024
    m_Localized: Bones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767207024726016
    m_Localized: Skull bones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767409299230720
    m_Localized: Belladone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767422154772480
    m_Localized: BELLADONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767440165113856
    m_Localized: usefull for making potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767647124656128
    m_Localized: FEATHER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767714518732800
    m_Localized: Feather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767744491229184
    m_Localized: Bird feather
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767894123024384
    m_Localized: Apple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7767947189358592
    m_Localized: Heal 10 LP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7768450799439872
    m_Localized: ANTIDOTE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7768504616554496
    m_Localized: Heal poison
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7768701312634880
    m_Localized: ELIXIR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7768767775576064
    m_Localized: Heal K.O
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7768949699317760
    m_Localized: Health potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7769109481328640
    m_Localized: Mana potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7769171250843648
    m_Localized: Restor 50 MP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7770203896877056
    m_Localized: Iron armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7770240504762368
    m_Localized: Basic iron armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7770369924206592
    m_Localized: Leather armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7770431655972864
    m_Localized: Leather armor, not very solid. Ideal for apprentice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7772943037435904
    m_Localized: Steel armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7773152228347904
    m_Localized: Steel armor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7775645528166400
    m_Localized: APPLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7775769042030592
    m_Localized: STRAWBERRY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7780024503177216
    m_Localized: 'Everyone wins '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7780824554082304
    m_Localized: 'You received '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7899895316549632
    m_Localized: HEALTH_POTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7908121646927872
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7916009077542912
    m_Localized: 'Got '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918670904496128
    m_Localized: This was not an easy match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918758120853504
    m_Localized: Yes, Hoppefully you were here Mok.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7918916350971904
    m_Localized: It is time to go home. We have an exam tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7919250045603840
    m_Localized: You're right, Let's go !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7919404102389760
    m_Localized: Before, take those health potion to heal you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7919595379429376
    m_Localized: Thank you !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7923486737240064
    m_Localized: Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7927097412227072
    m_Localized: Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7927175258509312
    m_Localized: Sonic thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7927212969496576
    m_Localized: Supersonic thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8206618493390848
    m_Localized: This is the iron we looking for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207015660425216
    m_Localized: I can get that back to this girl.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207305730101248
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207357663973376
    m_Localized: Wait !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207388450164736
    m_Localized: There is something wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207620135129088
    m_Localized: What is happening ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207708630749184
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8207765006389248
    m_Localized: There is something behind us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8208216498049024
    m_Localized: It is a rift opening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8208941462523904
    m_Localized: This mean that a powerful monster is comming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8218260228739072
    m_Localized: It is the first time that append in this donjon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8219038259548160
    m_Localized: What should we do ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8219440623325184
    m_Localized: n-knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8219560580419584
    m_Localized: There is no choice, we can't pass without fighting him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8219854315917312
    m_Localized: Marco, Vard, be carefull ! This fight will be more difficult than
      the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8241601480167424
    m_Localized: '**Sigh**'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8241656077422592
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8242167665070080
    m_Localized: Something wrong ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8242746588073984
    m_Localized: n-Girll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8242785611878400
    m_Localized: I have to create new armor for the shop but I need some materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8243341139054592
    m_Localized: What do you need ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8243438014894080
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8243486970810368
    m_Localized: I need some Iron. Without it I can't create the armors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8244537409081344
    m_Localized: And where could we find some Iron ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8244660352520192
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8244728648372224
    m_Localized: You can find some in the donjon near the village, but it is dangerous
      there, there are a lot of monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8246658590248960
    m_Localized: Don't worry, we are knight, we can go get some for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8248792807313408
    m_Localized: n-Girll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8248823576727552
    m_Localized: Really ! Thank you !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8249986053246976
    m_Localized: This is the iron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8250213426466816
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8250247224168448
    m_Localized: Thank you very much !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8252183046459392
    m_Localized: Thank to you, I will be able to continue make armors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8252608642486272
    m_Localized: I hope that I didn't cause any trouble to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8252794714394624
    m_Localized: No don't worry. This is nothing for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8253708279943168
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8253746519412736
    m_Localized: There is some strange creatures called metamorphs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8254055299878912
    m_Localized: They have an human looks but they can turn into animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8254489313873920
    m_Localized: There are dangerous. If you encounter one, kill it before it hurt
      someone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8255871810998272
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8256178792108032
    m_Localized: A thief stole my bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8256666665160704
    m_Localized: He is gone next to the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8257172296896512
    m_Localized: Please can you help me ? *snif*
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8257338642993152
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8257374294577152
    m_Localized: Thank you for bring me back my bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8311364302606336
    m_Localized: n-Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8311438806028288
    m_Localized: Donjons are dangerous. There are a lot of monsters in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8312137602240512
    m_Localized: Only autorise people can enter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8312653463883776
    m_Localized: n-Guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8312714205794304
    m_Localized: You can't go in the forest !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8313283486093312
    m_Localized: Are you all right ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8313394521903104
    m_Localized: But you're are wounded ?! Let us help you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8313647669121024
    m_Localized: No, we'll be ok. We just need some rest. Then we'll go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8313937969483776
    m_Localized: But you are not in condition ! And your friend is K.O.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8314442716221440
    m_Localized: Are you a metamorph ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8314612216434688
    m_Localized: Don't worry, you are in a safe place here. We won't hurt you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8315058456825856
    m_Localized: What happened ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8315126974976000
    m_Localized: I ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8315165973614592
    m_Localized: Is this the monsters in the forest who did that ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8421975430729728
    m_Localized: My grandpa is a healer. He can heal your wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8422771702566912
    m_Localized: It is nice of you, but we can't come with you in the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8423128008691712
    m_Localized: Why ? You need care !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8423577025712128
    m_Localized: People won't accept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8423688128630784
    m_Localized: But I can't let you here like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8423822816120832
    m_Localized: Here, take this cape to hide so you can come with us. My grandpa
      will take care of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8424234340257792
    m_Localized: He heal everyone, with no exception.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8424411503464448
    m_Localized: I will came with you because my friend is badly hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8424706274955264
    m_Localized: But once we're heal, we'll leave immediatelly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8424887720546304
    m_Localized: Yes of course, no problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8510662386585600
    m_Localized: Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8613136749498368
    m_Localized: Powerful attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8613366547025920
    m_Localized: ELIXIR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8623690415280128
    m_Localized: Cannot flee !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8623721906114560
    m_Localized: Escape fail !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8625752410624000
    m_Localized: Lighting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8626497826525184
    m_Localized: Nice, we found some apples.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8626664348782592
    m_Localized: Let's bring that back to the man.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8627898371739648
    m_Localized: I was able to heal your wound. Unfortunatelly I can't do anything
      for your friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8628907886186496
    m_Localized: Is he gonna die ?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8629050228281344
    m_Localized: No, I stabilize him. But the weapon that hurt him was magic, it
      prevent from healing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8630281478803456
    m_Localized: What should we do ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8631429673717760
    m_Localized: We need to ask the help of a witch. They know medicine unknown to
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8656648350142464
    m_Localized: Where can we find one ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8657121530548224
    m_Localized: This is the problem, they are not easy to find.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8657313344458752
    m_Localized: But if you go to Silverhood village after the forest, go talk to
      the potion seller. Maybe she can help you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8658863013957632
    m_Localized: Thank you for your help. We will go there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8659092807290880
    m_Localized: Alone ?! Let us go with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8659256284483584
    m_Localized: We already took a lot of your time. We will do the rest by ourself
      now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8659660607000576
    m_Localized: It is dangerous to go through the forest alone, especially with
      someone who is hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8660438553923584
    m_Localized: Moreover, this wound worried me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9017098208219136
    m_Localized: Who did him this wound ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9017258850062336
    m_Localized: Last time I saw a wound like that was during a fight with Moonshine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9017549137842176
    m_Localized: Are you pursued by their soldat ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9018075653017600
    m_Localized: Don't worry, you have nothing to worry here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9018361134125056
    m_Localized: But, I have to warn you, their soldier can be dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9018781281751040
    m_Localized: But I though that a peace was signed beetween your two nation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9019333638033408
    m_Localized: You helped us. So I am gonna tell you our story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9019495433310208
    m_Localized: My name is Yekel, and my friend Alexis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9020184335159296
    m_Localized: We encounter the king of Moonshine to sign a peace beetween usne.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9020813157797888
    m_Localized: But during the night we were something append to the king.n
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9021131748741120
    m_Localized: So we were accused of trying to kill the king.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9021277697937408
    m_Localized: Is he dead ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9021319141855232
    m_Localized: I don't know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9021410137280512
    m_Localized: There was 5 of us. 3 were killed by the soldier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9021612663443456
    m_Localized: We tried to escaped with Alexis but they found us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9022001865494528
    m_Localized: Alexis was wounded because he was trying to protect me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9022141066055680
    m_Localized: Then we go throught the forest to escape the soldier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9022435292286976
    m_Localized: This is were your grandson found us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9022697868300288
    m_Localized: Hum, this story is very disturbing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9023493615849472
    m_Localized: Now we are accused of being criminal. This will made our relationn
      more difficult.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9027625911259136
    m_Localized: Yes, this will have some consequence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9032410639044608
    m_Localized: We need to go see the king of SIyridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9032806363238400
    m_Localized: He always was a friend of metamorphs. Maybe he can help you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9033032100679680
    m_Localized: Yes, we always have a good relation with Skyridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9033223830704128
    m_Localized: At first, this is where we wanted to go but the soldier stopped
      us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9035668275269632
    m_Localized: I just hope that the prince of Moonshine did not talk to them before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9036007292473344
    m_Localized: Something is happening outside !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9036120987471872
    m_Localized: I feer the worst. Marco go see what happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9413497630429184
    m_Localized: 'Thanks for playing G.M.M demo.


      I hope you liked it.


      The
      full game will be available at the end of 2025.


      You can whishlist the
      game on steam or follow me on my instagram account mokratos_gaming if you want
      to be informed about the game.


      If you have any question or comment
      about the game you can post it on steam or send me a message on instagram.


      See
      you soon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415135254482944
    m_Localized: "\n\n\n\n\nCreated and developped by Mokratos Gaming\n\nDevelopped
      with Unity\n\n\nScenario : \n\n      Mokratos\n\n\nDevelopper : \n\n       
      Mokratos\n\n\nMusic : \n\n       alkakrab (unity assets)\n       Chris Kohler
      (unity assets)\n       Craze Music Productions (unity assets)\n        LisetteAmago
      (unity assets)\n\n\nSound : \n\n      Leohpaz (unity assets)\n\n\nTester :
      \n\n      Mokratos\n\n\n\nSpecial thanks : \n\n       Kingro\n       Naskel971\n      
      Will7\n       Lodinateur\n       LedLex\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15503407919599616
    m_Localized: Good ! Here are some health potion. It will be usefull for your
      battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15503455478812672
    m_Localized: Thanks grandpa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15503478652342272
    m_Localized: Don't hesitate to came see us if you're hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15503956123521024
    m_Localized: We are going to review the fight basics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15505345130205184
    m_Localized: You should get some rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15505528589062144
    m_Localized: But if you want, you can go to the forest north for more training.
      This is the perfect place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15505956194160640
    m_Localized: Mok will be happy to go with you if you talk to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20104833530531840
    m_Localized: I will keep an eye on this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20105022018359296
    m_Localized: Hey you ! What are you doing ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20105147402883072
    m_Localized: Go to the village centre place with the other !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20109796793061376
    m_Localized: heal state
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
